    "titleText": {
      "es": "Presionaría sobre ellos para intentar arreglarlos, pero no alcanzo. ¿Podemos intentar pasar de la noche al día muy rápido?",
      "en": "I'd press on them to try to unstick them, but I can't reach. Can we try cycling day and night really fast?",
      "noteEn": "The title text extends the screen metaphor: the tiny colored points in the sky behave like stuck or dead pixels that someone might press or refresh."
    },
